// Wide-radius burst-damage `Explosion`, same shape as circle_of_death.ron
// scaled up for circle 8. Sheet's `aoe: Cone 9` normalized to a spherical
// `radius` -- `Explosion` has no cone-shaped falloff, only radial (same
// simplification the sheet's own `notes` field already applies: "Area
// normalized to a sphere zone"). Sheet's "constructs and the walking dead
// feel nothing of its grasp" creature-kind immunity dropped, same class of
// drop as negative_energy_flood.ron's own undead-immunity rider.
Explosion(
    energy_cost: 195.0,
    buildup_duration: 1.0,
    action_duration: 0.35,
    recover_duration: 0.6,
    damage: 82,
    poise: 25,
    knockback: (direction: Away, strength: 12.0),
    radius: 9,
    min_falloff: 0.3,
    dodgeable: Roll,
    destroy_terrain: None,
    eye_height: false,
    reagent: Some(Purple),
    meta: (
        school: Some(Necromancy),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        cooldown: Some(55.0),
        // level 8 spell -> min_level 48, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(48)),
    ),
)
